---
import Masthead from "$lib/components/Masthead.astro";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy: Tools"
  description="Tools run entirely in your browser. Files you open are never uploaded."
>
  <Masthead title="Privacy">
    <p class="tagline">
      Tools run entirely in your web browser. Files you open are processed on your device
      and are never uploaded to us or anyone else.
    </p>
  </Masthead>

  <main class="page">
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>No accounts, cookies, analytics or tracking.</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Hosting:</strong> the site is served by GitHub Pages. GitHub may log requests
        (including IP addresses) under the{" "}
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
          GitHub Privacy Statement
        </a>
        .
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Third-party requests:</strong> to work, your browser downloads the DuckDB engine
        from cdn.jsdelivr.net, its spatial extension from extensions.duckdb.org, and basemap tiles
        from tiles.openfreemap.org. "Try with demo data" loads files from data.source.coop. If you
        paste a URL, your browser fetches it directly. These services receive normal request
        information such as your IP address. None of them receive the contents of your files.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Questions: open an issue at{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/OCHA-DAP/cod-site/issues">
        github.com/OCHA-DAP/cod-site
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .page ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .page li + li {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
